OL,3,GNEWSAUK Online Safety Act not discussed
OL,4,Aby ministers                           
OL,6,FJersey ministers have not formally     
OL,7,Fdiscussed extending the UK's Online    
OL,8,FSafety Act to the island, amid calls   
OL,9,Ffor tougher safeguards around          
OL,10,Fchildren's use of social media.        
OL,12,FIn a written response, the government  
OL,13,Fsaid the Council of Ministers had not  
OL,14,Fformally discussed requesting a        
OL,15,FPermissive Extent Clause for the UK's  
OL,16,FOnline Safety Act 2023, which could    
OL,17,Fallow parts of the legislation to be   
OL,18,Fextended to Jersey.                    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
