OL,3,GNEWSAUK Online Safety Act not discussed
OL,4,Aby ministers                           
OL,6,FMinisters have previously said in their
OL,7,Fpriorities for the next four years that
OL,8,Fthey would give "particular attention  
OL,9,Fto online safety for children and young
OL,10,Fpeople".                               
OL,12,FWhile ministers have not discussed     
OL,13,Fextending the UK legislation, work is  
OL,14,Funder way on Jersey's own laws.        
